# CDJ-2000NXS GUI board additions for GNU sim's BF531 model.
#
# The same board as cdj2000-gui.hw, but the CFI flash carries the NXS GUI flash
# image rather than the CDJ-2000 one.
#
# The GUI ELF and the CFI flash image are a matched pair, and mismatching them
# is a trap worth knowing about.  The firmware's own LZSS decompressor reads its
# packed resource bytes straight out of this memory-mapped CFI device at run
# time, while the 480x234 geometry comes from code already resident in the boot
# image and does not depend on this file.  So booting the NXS GUI ELF against
# cdj2000-gui.hw still boots and still paints the right rectangles -- only the
# resource *content* comes out wrong.  "Geometry correct, content is noise" is
# the signature of a mismatched pair, not of a broken decompressor.
#
# Use this board file whenever the loaded ELF was built from NXS firmware.
#
# The 2 MiB parallel flash spans EBIU asynchronous banks 0 and 1.
/core/bfin_ebiu_amc/cfi@0/reg 0 2
/core/bfin_ebiu_amc/cfi@0/cmdset 2
/core/bfin_ebiu_amc/cfi@0/size 0x200000
/core/bfin_ebiu_amc/cfi@0/width 16
/core/bfin_ebiu_amc/cfi@0/erase_regions 32 0x10000
/core/bfin_ebiu_amc/cfi@0/file "firmware/nxs/gui-flash-image.bin"

/core/bfin_ppi@0/color "rgb555le"
